			"notes": "New Features\n\n- Auto-add to map for sublevels with a Nameplate or Contraption Diagram\n\nBug Fixes\n\n- Train Track rendering smoothed out, configurable Track width\n- Fixed multiple sublevels tooltips rendering on top of each other\n- Fixed rename modal opening for the wrong (non-hovered) ship\n- Antique Atlas is no longer required on the server\n- Save file path moved to world/data/ with clearer naming; old files are migrated automatically"
		},
