			"notes": "New Features:\n- Ship previews - ships on the map now render as live diagrams (thanks to Create: Aeronautics), with adjustable max zoom level\n- OP teleportation to any sublevel directly from the map\n- Automatic cleanup of sublevels that no longer exist in the world\nBug Fixes:\n-Fixed clicking a ship repeatedly making the darkening effect stack infinitely\n-Fixed being unable to type the atlas keybind (default M) in ship name fields\n-Fixed hovering other ships while inside the ship preview\n-Fixed multiple tooltips showing simultaneously"
		},
